I want to build AI agent which will create pods, deployments, services in kubernetes using open source LLM
================================


Excellent choice, Suresh. This project is complex enough to teach you how AI agents really work, but simple enough to build from scratch without frameworks.

My recommendation:

Build the agent incrementally and don't use LangChain/CrewAI initially.

We'll build a Kubernetes AI Agent in 10 phases.

