Directory:

k8s-agent/
    main.py

Install:

pip install ollama
main.py
from ollama import chat

while True:
    question = input("You: ")

    response = chat(
        model="qwen3:8b",
        messages=[
            {
                "role": "user",
                "content": question
            }
        ]
    )

    print(response["message"]["content"])
Stop here

Make sure this works before proceeding.

